# FrankAI - Environment Variables
# This project currently uses mock data only — no env vars are required to run.
# When you integrate a real backend, add your keys here and rename to .env.local

# Example (for future real API integration):
# NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://your-api.com
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
